OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after taxi driven wrong way
OL,4,Aon dual carriageway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after police
OL,7,Fstopped a taxi travelling the wrong way
OL,8,Fdown a dual carriageway, after a
OL,9,Fcyclist was knocked off their bike and
OL,10,Fparked cars were also damaged.
OL,12,FOfficers intervened on the A55 on
OL,13,FAnglesey on Monday evening and
OL,14,Ftemporarily closed the road, with
OL,15,Ffootage on social media appearing to
OL,16,Fshow a taxi being pulled over by police
OL,17,Fvehicles.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
