OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after taxi driven wrong way
OL,4,Aon dual carriageway
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Wales Police said that before the
OL,7,Ftaxi had gone onto the road the cyclist
OL,8,Fhad been knocked off their bike on
OL,9,FLondon Road in nearby Holyhead, and
OL,10,Fseveral parked vehicles had also been
OL,11,Fdamaged.
OL,13,FThe cyclist was taken to hospital with
OL,14,Fnon-life threatening injuries, and the
OL,15,Farrested man remained in custody on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
